      <h1>KATA<span>Cut. Shuffle. Play.</span></h1>
      <p class="kata-lede">KATA (Swahili for “cut”) chops a loop, or the sound of a video, into slices and plays them back as new patterns in time with your song. Drop a loop on it, press Shuffle until something hits, lock the steps you like and shuffle the rest.</p>
